<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπλέκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weave, plait,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάνδαλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					80
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλύω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.67
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τὸν ὄσχεον διαπλέκοντα
				σώματα</span> Paul.Age.<i><span class="en">
				6.62
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρῆνον δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					12.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγὰν πάγχυ δ.</span>
			<i>to try</i> every <i>twist, wind</i> all ways, ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.82
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπλέξασθαι κόμας</span>
			<i>plait one's</i> hair, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.25
			</span></i>: —
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ διαπλακεῖσα</span>
			<i>interwoven</i> [with matter] . ., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				36e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				1.1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπλέξαντος τὸν βίον εὖ</span>
			<i>finish the web of</i> one's life, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.92
			</span></i>.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ́; δ. βίοτον λιπαρῷ γήραϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.99
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμέραν</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				23.38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκητικόν τινα βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					806a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				231
			</span></i>: without 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίον, δ. ζῶν ἡδέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					754
				</span></i>
			.</div>
